{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-x5-z5-automorphism","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:x5-z5-automorphism","kind":"proposition","title":"$\\mathbb{Z}_5$ automorphism of the hyperelliptic quintic","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-hyperelliptic-quintic","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-lagrange-resolvents"],"tags":["automorphism","z5","roots-of-unity","hyperelliptic"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.HyperellipticQuintic.z5_automorphism","text":"x5-z5-automorphism.md","leanSource":"x5-z5-automorphism.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:x5-z5-automorphism\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{X}_5 \\colon y^2 = x^5 - 1</code> be the hyperelliptic quintic of Definition <a href=\"#def:hyperelliptic-quintic\" data-at=\"brings-surface/bring-algebraic-substructure\">8.3.1</a>. The map</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\phi_5 \\colon \\mathcal{X}_5 \\longrightarrow \\mathcal{X}_5,\n  \\qquad\n  \\phi_5(x, y)  =  (\\zeta_5 x,\\, y),\n  \\qquad\n  \\zeta_5  =  e^{2\\pi i/5},</code></pre>\n<p>with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\zeta_5</code> a primitive fifth root of unity, is an automorphism of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{X}_5</code> of order <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">5</code>. It generates a cyclic group <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\langle \\phi_5 \\rangle \\cong \\mathbb{Z}_5</code> inside <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{Aut}(\\mathcal{X}_5)</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/x5-z5-automorphism.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"8.3.2","page":"b/prop-x5-z5-automorphism","qa":{"counts":{"pass":99,"fail":0,"warn":3,"na":17,"unknown":0,"stale":64},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.HyperellipticQuintic.z5_automorphism","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/x5-z5-automorphism.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
